 notes=coalesce(notes,'')||chr(10)||$q$2026-11-03 DECLINED (decision of record): email from Best Buy Social Impact (via Submittable) Tue Nov 3 2026 16:08:00 UTC = 10:08 am CST, Message-ID <20261103160800.a62512bf7238ec92@email.submittable.com>, to stephen@selassiefest.com. Funds only tech-education programs in Atlanta, Los Angeles, New York City and the Twin Cities. The Dec 1 follow-up is cancelled. Earlier lines above saying "if strong fit, Best Buy invites Step 2" no longer apply. [src:msgid-20261103160800.a62512bf7238ec92]$q$
where id='532ee394-3b93-43f4-9f76-2fe384df2d30' and status='submitted' and next_step like 'Corporate Funding Step 1 SUBMITTED Oct 31%' and coalesce(notes,'') not like '%[src:msgid-20261103160800.a62512bf7238ec92]%';

