 notes=coalesce(notes,'')||chr(10)||$q$[2026-11-02] DCASE REPLY from Julie Partynski (Mon Nov 2 2026 13:02:29 UTC = 7:02 am CST), Message-ID <SA1PR09MB75030FD94ED39AA7B6EC3F94E86A2@SA1PR09MB7503.namprd09.prod.outlook.com>, answering our Oct 31 questions email (quoted in her reply as sent Sat Oct 31 7:20 PM CT): "currently closing out our 2026 Programs, but will be announcing 2027 programs soon"; sign up for the newsletter to be notified when they open; "we will provide training." NOT answered: 2027 NAP and CityArts opening dates, the 12-month incorporation rule, whether pre-incorporation work counts, same-neighborhood test, a 2027 festival grant. The Nov 18 email (Resend 01a1f257) was a second, new message and does not reference this reply. [src:msgid-SA1PR09MB75030FD94ED39AA7B6EC3F94E86A2]$q$
where id='bb5d4340-0ec1-4da1-9b19-3ad9734ec5ed' and next_step like 'Questions EMAIL SENT Nov 18, 2026 to CulturalGrantMaking@cityofchicago.org (%' and coalesce(notes,'') not like '%[src:msgid-SA1PR09MB75030FD94ED39AA7B6EC3F94E86A2]%';
