 notes=coalesce(notes,'')||chr(10)||$q$2026-11-02 REPLY from Staci Ybarra, Catering Coordinator, The Buona Companies (Mon Nov 2 2026 17:55:17 UTC = 11:55 am CST), Message-ID <BYAPR01MB4150F5D9DAE811E08291E126AA6A2@BYAPR01MB4150.prod.exchangelabs.com>, replying to our Nov 1 email: four questions to review with their sales manager (weeks per year; budget per serving; other supporters; realistic benefit-night attendance). The Nov 18 "no reply logged" wording was wrong; the tabling decision stands until Stephen decides. [src:msgid-BYAPR01MB4150F5D9DAE811E08291E126AA6A2]$q$
