 notes=coalesce(notes,'')||chr(10)||$q$2026-11-03 to 11-04 NEH replies from Jill Austin, Senior Program Officer, Division of Lifelong Learning: Nov 3 19:03:48 UTC = 1:03 pm CST, Message-ID <DS0PR09MB1079042929B45AFD1CF929EBCB7692@DS0PR09MB10790.namprd09.prod.outlook.com> (advice above; Q&A Tue Nov 10 at 2 pm ET; recorded for registrants; deadline anticipated again late fall or December 2027). Nov 4 19:08:19 UTC, <DS0PR09MB10790D42AD19B9FADEDCBFE9BB7682@DS0PR09MB10790.namprd09.prod.outlook.com>: Stephen could not open the registration link; she said to register from the program page. Nov 4 19:19:02 UTC, <DS0PR09MB10790A163E002050066C341B0B7682@DS0PR09MB10790.namprd09.prod.outlook.com>: Stephen wrote "Registered"; she replied "Great!". This supersedes the "waiting on NEH reply" and Dec 4 nudge wording above; the Nov 13 line saying the recording does not change that wait is also superseded. [src:msgid-DS0PR09MB1079042929B45AFD1CF929EBCB7692]$q$
